  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10844": "MARIE: 亚历珊德拉？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10845": "ALEXANDRA: 怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10846": "MARIE: 冷柜里的菲力都卖完了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10847": "ALEXANDRA: 真的？哇。你不在时，从没卖出过这么多肉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10848": "MARIE: 看到哪位妈妈满脸忧愁地进来，就是还没想好晚饭做什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10849": "MARIE: 顺势推荐个菜谱，店里的鸭腿又恰好便宜，转眼整条街都在吃砂锅焖豆了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10850": "ALEXANDRA: （怎么拯救世界都比开店简单……？）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10851": "MARIE: 对了，去冰箱看看，应该还剩一箱牛肉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10852": "ALEXANDRA: 好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10853": "MARIE: 不，亲爱的，另一个冰箱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10854": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10855": "MARIE: 啊，在这儿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10856": "MARIE: 还够冷，能保鲜吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10857": "ALEXANDRA: 够，那边一年到头都冷。唯一的麻烦，大概是熊会不会找到路进来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10858": "MARIE: 嗯！熊。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10859": "MARIE: 啊，大部分是腹胁肉。红葱头和橙子也一起打折吧，够人家做顿好晚餐。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10860": "MARIE: 怎么了，有什么不对吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10861": "ALEXANDRA: 没有，妈妈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/credits.yarn-alexCreditsStinger-10862": "ALEXANDRA: 一切都很好。",
